OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,FOne person has died and hundreds of
OL,8,Fothers have been affected by a
OL,9,Fsalmonella outbreak in the UK, health
OL,10,Fofficials have said.
OL,12,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,13,Fsaid the food poisoning outbreak "may
OL,14,Fbe linked to eggs imported from
OL,15,Foutside the UK".
OL,17,FBabies and people as old as 90 have
OL,18,Fbeen affected, it added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
