OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787057312
OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,FSalmonella generally causes a self-
OL,8,Flimiting gastroenteritis, with
OL,9,Fsymptoms including stomach cramps,
OL,10,Fdiarrhoea, vomiting or fever.
OL,12,FMore than a third of people affected
OL,13,Fin the outbreak, 38%, were admitted to
OL,14,Fhospital, with two people developing
OL,15,Fpotentially life-threatening
OL,16,Fbloodstream infections.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
