OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,FUKHSA said between August 11 last year
OL,8,Fand August 1 this year, 207 cases have
OL,9,Fbeen confirmed: 199 in England, six in
OL,10,FScotland, one in Wales and one in
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,13,FLondon, where 47 cases were confirmed,
OL,14,Fand Yorkshire and Humber (38) were the
OL,15,Fmost affected regions.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
