OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787057312
OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,FHannah Charles, lead epidemiologist
OL,8,Ffor gastrointestinal infections at
OL,9,FUKHSA, said they were working with the
OL,10,FFood Standards Agency and other public
OL,11,Fhealth agencies to investigate the
OL,12,Foutbreak.
OL,14,F"Salmonellosis is often caused by
OL,15,Feating or handling contaminated food
OL,16,Fand can be spread rarely from person-
OL,17,Fto-person," she said.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
