OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,F"Salmonella generally causes a mild
OL,8,Fillness, although vulnerable groups
OL,9,Fwith weakened immune systems may
OL,10,Fexperience more severe illness."
OL,12,FWhat are the symptoms of salmonella?
OL,14,FSymptoms of salmonella typically start
OL,15,F12 to 72 hours after infection,
OL,16,Faccording to the NHS.
OL,18,FThey include:
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
