CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787057312
OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,F"Anyone who is concerned about
OL,8,Fsymptoms should contact their GP or
OL,9,Fout-of-hours service in the first
OL,10,Finstance," added Ms Charles.
OL,12,FHow can you prevent its spread?
OL,14,FMs Charles explained there are several
OL,15,Fsimple steps to help prevent the
OL,16,Fspread of salmonella.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
