FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787057312
OL,3,COne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Csalmonella outbreak 'linked to
OL,5,Cimported eggs'
OL,7,FThese include washing your hands
OL,8,Fthoroughly after using the bathroom
OL,9,Fand before preparing and handling
OL,10,Ffood, cooking food thoroughly, and, if
OL,11,Fyou have any symptoms, avoiding
OL,12,Fhandling food for others where
OL,13,Fpossible.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
